  <slave-step-copy-partition-distribution>
  </slave-step-copy-partition-distribution>
  <slave_workflow>N</slave_workflow>
  <groups>
  </groups>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: NETC FASTag 4-way reconciliation. Plaza RFID reads (XML) are sorted by EPC + reader time; a stateful scan flags&#xd;&#xa;multi-antenna double reads (same EPC, same plaza, re-read &lt; DOUBLE_READ_WINDOW_SEC, default 60s) and numbers each read per EPC.&#xd;&#xa;The NPCI mapper clearing file (driving side) is numbered per EPC in TXN_ID order and joined to the plaza reads on EPC + sequence,&#xd;&#xa;then to the FASTag wallet CBS dump and the concessionaire GL-9908 pool on RRN.&#xd;&#xa;Exceptions: MULTI_ANTENNA_DOUBLE_DEBIT, WALLET_DEBIT_NO_PLAZA_CLEARANCE, BLACKLISTED_TAG_PASSAGE, LOW_BALANCE_OVERDRAFT,&#xd;&#xa;CONCESSIONAIRE_FEE_DISPUTE, MISSING_IN_WALLET_CBS / CONCESSIONAIRE_GL, EPC_MISMATCH, WALLET_DEBIT_FAILED, SETTLEMENT_PENDING.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Params: INPUT_DIR, OUTPUT_DIR, DOUBLE_READ_WINDOW_SEC (config), CYCLE_ID (runtime).&#xd;&#xa;Output: Matched_NETC_Records_&lt;yyyyMMdd_HHmmss&gt;.xlsx / Unmatched_NETC_Records_&lt;yyyyMMdd_HHmmss&gt;.xlsx, returned as&#xd;&#xa;o_matched_file / o_unmatched_file and attached to the workflow result.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: feeds pre-validated (missing feed = Failure); malformed XML/CSV rows go down per-feed error hops to the error log.</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
      <yloc>780</yloc>
      <width>900</width>
      <heigth>300</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>192</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>192</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>192</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
      <shadow_size>5</shadow_size>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
</transformation>
